---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy - Intentional Thrive"
  description="How Intentional Thrive handles personal information shared through the website."
>
  <header class="page-shell page-shell--light">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="pill">Privacy</span>
      <h1 style="margin-top: 0.75rem;">Privacy matters here.</h1>
      <p class="section-intro">This page explains how information shared through Intentional Thrive is handled.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="section-block section-block--white">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>Information you share</h2>
      <p>If you email, message, request an assessment, or ask a question, Venus may receive your name, contact details, and the financial context you choose to provide.</p>

      <h2>How it is used</h2>
      <p>Your information is used to respond to your inquiry, prepare for a conversation, share relevant resources, or follow up on a service or career question.</p>

      <h2>How it is protected</h2>
      <p>Personal information should be shared thoughtfully. Do not send sensitive documents through ordinary email unless Venus specifically asks for them and gives you a safer process.</p>

      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>For privacy questions, contact <a href="mailto:venus@intentionalthrive.com">venus@intentionalthrive.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>
